      "content": "stop fighting... it just sounds like giving up. but honestly, i don't know if i even have the energy to keep fighting. everything feels so finished. like the book is already closed and i'm just some footnote at the end that nobody is reading. is there even any dignity in staying when you've already outlived your time?",
